# DNA-AND content · life · archaea (domain Archaea)
# researched: Pearson biology study guides (archaea vs bacteria, extremophiles); standard microbiology
# Spec: docs/CONTENT-FORMAT.md · wiki/systems/r08-life-sim.md

# ── What makes them different ──

@trait no-peptidoglycan
name: Different cell walls
real: yes
says: archaea walls lack the material bacterial walls are made of

@trait ether-lipids
name: Different cell skin
real: yes
says: their membranes are built differently, tough enough for boiling and acid

@trait eukaryote-like
name: Close cousins of complex cells
real: yes
says: their gene-reading machinery is more like that of plants and animals than that of bacteria

# ── Extremophiles ──

@extreme hyperthermophile
name: Heat lover
real: yes
says: lives near boiling water and above
example: Methanopyrus, growing at about 98 °C at deep-sea vents

@extreme halophile
name: Salt lover
real: yes
says: lives in water around ten times saltier than the sea

@extreme acidophile
name: Acid lover
real: yes
example: Sulfolobus, in acidic hot springs

@extreme methanogen
name: Methane maker
real: yes
says: makes methane from hydrogen and carbon dioxide, with no oxygen; lives in swamps, guts and sea mud

@extreme psychrophile
name: Cold lover
real: yes
says: lives in ice and freezing seas

# ── Main groups (phyla) ──

@phylum euryarchaeota
name: Euryarchaeota
real: yes
domain: archaea
says: methane makers and salt lovers

@phylum crenarchaeota
name: Crenarchaeota
real: yes
domain: archaea
says: heat and acid lovers

@phylum thaumarchaeota
name: Thaumarchaeota
real: yes
domain: archaea
says: ammonia eaters in oceans and soil

@phylum asgard
name: Asgard archaea
real: yes
domain: archaea
says: the closest living relatives of complex cells

# ── Generator rules ──

@rule archaea-extremes
real: rule
says: archaea fill the worst places first (vents, acid, salt, ice), so they're often the first life on hard worlds

@rule archaea-swallowed
real: rule
says: an archaean swallowing a bacterium is one route to complex cells (the "swallowed partners" stage)

@rule archaea-methane
real: rule
says: methane makers warm young planets by filling the air with methane
